  "steps": [
    {
      "text_en": "<size=24><color=#5B6B7F>Check my work and repair fan F2</color></size>\n<size=46><b>Check and repair fan F2 for vibration or knocking, then reassemble.</b></size>\n\n<size=34>Grip: hold guards/blade, move, release.\nTrigger: hold clip/threaded fasteners, move, release; press for Main.</size>\n\n<size=34><color=#2E7D32>Fit all guards and Check my work. It runs for 3 seconds. Passed/ready means done.</color></size>"
    },
    {
      "text_en": "<size=24><color=#5B6B7F>Start</color></size>\n<size=46><b>Choose an area of F2 to check</b></size>\n\n<size=34><color=#4A5A6E>Power isolated. Leave motor, base, pole and head alone.</color></size>\n\n<size=34><color=#2E7D32><b>✓</b> Any order; not every area is required.</color></size>"
    },
    {
      "text_en": "<size=24><color=#5B6B7F>Check</color></size>\n<size=46><b>Look at the front guard and rear rim</b></size>\n\n<size=34><color=#2E7D32><b>✓</b> Normal: front flush, marks aligned, clip closed; rear rim still against head.</color></size>"
    },
    {
      "text_en": "<size=24><color=#5B6B7F>Open</color></size>\n<size=46><b>To reach the blade, remove the front guard</b></size>\n\n<size=34><color=#4A5A6E>Open clip, turn along marks, pull straight off and release.</color></size>\n\n<size=34><color=#2E7D32><b>✓</b> The blade is visible.</color></size>"
    },
    {
      "text_en": "<size=24><color=#5B6B7F>Check</color></size>\n<size=46><b>With the front off, look at the blade and cap</b></size>\n\n<size=34><color=#2E7D32><b>✓</b> Normal: groove fully on pin; cap tight.</color></size>"
    },
    {
      "text_en": "<size=24><color=#5B6B7F>Open</color></size>\n<size=46><b>To remove the blade, loosen its cap</b></size>\n\n<size=34><color=#4A5A6E>Clockwise, viewed from the front.</color></size>\n\n<size=34><color=#2E7D32><b>✓</b> Once unthreaded, remove and release.</color></size>"
    },
    {
      "text_en": "<size=24><color=#5B6B7F>Open</color></size>\n<size=46><b>With the cap off, pull the blade along the shaft</b></size>\n\n<size=34><color=#2E7D32><b>✓</b> Put it down. The rear ring face is visible.</color></size>"
    },
    {
      "text_en": "<size=24><color=#5B6B7F>Check</color></size>\n<size=46><b>Check the ring and rear guard movement</b></size>\n\n<size=34><color=#4A5A6E>Fitted/threaded is not tight. Removing access parts is not a repair.</color></size>\n\n<size=34><color=#2E7D32><b>✓</b> Normal: the ring is tight.</color></size>"
    },
    {
      "text_en": "<size=24><color=#5B6B7F>If the rear guard moves</color></size>\n<size=46><b>If rear is loose/misaligned, remove ring and realign</b></size>\n\n<size=34><color=#4A5A6E>From front: loosen counterclockwise, tighten clockwise.</color></size>\n\n<size=34><color=#2E7D32><b>✓</b> Do not pull while threaded on. Tighten until rim stays still.</color></size>"
    },
    {
      "text_en": "<size=24><color=#5B6B7F>Reassemble</color></size>\n<size=46><b>Refit blade: groove on pin</b></size>\n\n<size=34><color=#4A5A6E>Push fully in and release.</color></size>\n\n<size=34><color=#2E7D32><b>✓</b> The blade does not wobble.</color></size>"
    },
    {
      "text_en": "<size=24><color=#5B6B7F>Reassemble</color></size>\n<size=46><b>Tighten the blade cap</b></size>\n\n<size=34><color=#4A5A6E>Counterclockwise, viewed from the front.</color></size>\n\n<size=34><color=#2E7D32><b>✓</b> Release when tight.</color></size>"
    },
    {
      "text_en": "<size=24><color=#5B6B7F>Reassemble</color></size>\n<size=46><b>Refit the removed front guard</b></size>\n\n<size=34><color=#4A5A6E>Align marks, seat flush, turn to lock and close clip.</color></size>\n\n<size=34><color=#2E7D32><b>✓</b> Both guards on; clip closed.</color></size>"
    },
    {
      "text_en": "<size=24><color=#5B6B7F>Check my work</color></size>\n<size=46><b>Select Check my work on Main and listen</b></size>\n\n<size=34><color=#4A5A6E>A 3-second run: hear the symptom before repair or check afterwards.</color></size>\n\n<size=34><color=#2E7D32><b>✓</b> Passed/ready means done.</color></size>"
    },
    {
      "text_en": "<size=24><color=#5B6B7F>If not passed</color></size>\n<size=46><b>Read the result, correct and retry</b></size>\n\n<size=34><color=#4A5A6E>Missing guards: no test. Abnormal sound: still loose or misaligned.</color></size>\n\n<size=34><color=#2E7D32><b>✓</b> System fault: tell researcher. Not your fault.</color></size>"
    }
  ],
